      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "turn off avatars for everyone but friends and avatar culling (including friends is the only option sadly if you are below a mid tier pc for VR.\n\ntry to use every trick to reduce resources taking up your CPU and GPU including reducing the resolution set inside oculus and steamVR (disable dynamic bitrate and set the max bitrate to 200 really helped me to get a stable fps with lots of people in a world)",
