      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b9ab9ce22d5f33c2c26c00f|full_name}\n\nThing is, I have a Ryzen 5 5600X and RX5700XT, so I should be comfortably in the mid-tier range, and I use VDS with HEVC Encoding @ 200mbps to my headset using some random isolated router that has 5ghz wifi. My FPS is Fairly stable most of the time, but it's just when loading in the avatars initially is when my computer crashes without a BSOD and just reboots.",
