  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-19T08:12:12.310Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've had issues with my PC Crashing, and I've always noticed it's been due to my PC trying to download, then load multiple avatars, some of which place worse in the 'very poor' scale then others. I'd like a more direct way to limit how many avatars I can download at once, instead of having to use Avatar Culling, as Avatar Culling could still cause issues if I were to, say, walk near a group of people.",
